  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_frncat",
      "name": {
        "en": "Mousse's Badge",
        "zh": "慕斯证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_frncat",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Mousse has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for inflicting Arts damage on the enemy in close-quarters combat.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Guard Operator during field operations to exercise Arts Fighter responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员慕斯擅长在近身搏斗中对敌人造成法术杀伤\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为近卫干员，行使术战者职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_frncat",
      "name": {
        "en": "Clawcure Set with Duality",
        "zh": "美爪套装二象性",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_frncat",
      "description": {
        "en": "'So, Mousse, turns out the kitty paw prints really did lead me to your hiding spot.'\n'Haze? I wasn't trying to hide. It's just that lately my hands have been...'\n'C'mon, don't be shy now; I wasn't talking about your hands. I meant these.'\nBefore Mousse realizes it, a half-knitted pair of fingerless gloves has appeared on Haze's hands.\n'Paw pad gloves, hm? Bit of a fashion statement, don't you think? Especially for you. Oh, but don't get me wrong—they look cute on you. You gonna wear them to field training?'\nMousse hesitates, gauging Haze's reaction. Seeing the genuine approval on her face, she nods.\n'I heard that field training involves a lot of hands-on exercises where they call up the operators to demonstrate. There's no way I'd be able to hide my hands. So I thought, instead of keeping them hidden behind my back, I should make them look less intimidating. See, uh, with these soft, fluffy gloves, they don't look nearly as scary.'\n'...You still hate your hands that much, huh. Guess I was right to bring this then. Take your time reading it. Later.'\n'This is—huh?! Haze, you brought me a battle report? And now you're just walking away?'\nThe report Haze brought details a combat mission Mousse had been assigned to. The vehicle she was riding in was ambushed and set ablaze. All the operators inside were trapped behind a jammed door, unable to escape. With no time to think, Mousse used her mutated hands to tear an opening, allowing everyone to get out safely. Because of that, she had been encouraged to apply for field operator training.\nMousse looks at the combat report again. At first, she can't help but look at her 'terrifying' hands. However, her focus gradually shifts to the operators in the vehicle. She thinks about how they worked together and how she had felt at that moment—so overwhelmed she had nearly cried. She looks down at her hands, lost in thought.\n'Welcome, everyone, to basic field operator training. First, let's meet our newest recruit. Mousse, come up and introduce yourself!'\nMousse hesitantly steps onto the stage, keeping her hands behind her back as she looks out at the other operators.\n'Hello... everyone.'\nShe takes a deep breath, then slowly raises her hands in greeting. All eyes turn to her hands, and the gloves she's wearing. The gloves look fluffy, but her sharp black claws, meticulously polished, are peeking out of them, even more prominent than before.\n'I hope my hands can become a force that protects everyone.' Her voice is quiet, but firm.",
        "zh": "“慕斯。果然跟着猫猫的爪印就能找到你躲藏的地方。”\n“夜烟？我没有刻意躲啦。只是最近我的手又……”\n“让我看看。别藏了，不是指你的手，是这个。”\n不知何时出现在夜烟手中的，是一副正在编织的半指手套。\n“唔，肉垫手套？和你之前拘谨的风格一点不像啊。别误会，这样更可爱。准备戴着这个去参加外勤培训吗？”\n慕斯不太自信地观察着夜烟的反应，看到对方脸上是真诚的赞扬后，她点了点头。\n“我听说，外勤培训里有很多操作环节，干员还会被指名上去演示。我的手无论如何都藏不住了。所以我想，与其总是藏在身后，不如，把手变成不那么可怕的样子。软乎乎的手套，看，戴上后我的手看起来不那么凶狠了吧——夜烟？你还在听吗？”\n“……你还是那么讨厌你的手啊。看来，把这个带过来是对的。你自己慢慢看，我先走了。”\n“这是——欸？！夜烟，你把作战记录带出来了？走掉了。”\n夜烟带来的那份作战记录中，慕斯负责的是物资支援工作。然而，她所乘坐的车遭遇敌袭，着了火，整车的内勤干员都被困在卡住的车门后无法逃脱。那时的她来不及思考，拼尽全力用异化的手在车门上撕开了一个口子，终于使全车的人得救。而她也因为这件事，被鼓励申请参加外勤干员的培训。\n慕斯把作战记录又看了一遍。一开始，她总盯着自己那双“可怕”的手，渐渐地，她的目光移向了车上的干员们。她注意到他们如何与她齐心协力，她回想起当时的自己又是如何激动得想哭。慕斯若有所思地望向自己的手。\n“欢迎大家来参加外勤干员的基础培训。首先，让我们一起见见新加入的干员。慕斯，来打个招呼吧？”\n慕斯羞涩地走上讲台，将双手藏在背后，望向台下的干员们。\n“大家……好。”\n她吸了口气，抬起手，做了个打招呼的姿势。众人一齐望过去，她的手上戴着一副毛茸茸的、看起来极其柔软的肉垫手套。然而，露出手套的是黑色的利爪，被仔细打磨过，锋利油亮，比从前更加显眼了。\n“希望我的手，能成为守护大家的力量。”她小声但坚定地说。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
